The three-act drill is complete. Summary:

## 1. Diagnose
`/app/agent-output/M6-sleep-tool/diagnosis.md` — nine findings against the live host (`dsh 0.1.2-alpha.2`, `dsh-tools`/`dsh-llm` `0.1.2-rc.1`, `@deepseek-ai/cordis` `4.0.4`), each with reproducible evidence:

| Class | Finding | Measured evidence |
|---|---|---|
| Type source | `Context` from bare `cordis` | TS2307 + `ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND` (no bare package, no loader alias) |
| Type source | `ContentBlock` moved to `@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm` | TS2614; `dsh-tools/index.d.ts:9` imports, doesn't re-export |
| Type source | `ToolRunContext` did **not** move (anti-over-migration) | still at `dsh-tools/index.d.ts:284`, clean probe |
| Peer cohort | `dsh-tools@^0.0.1-rc.1` unsatisfiable; `cordis` names the wrong package; `dsh-llm` peer missing | semver `false`; package-identity mismatch; first-party peers all `^0.1.2-rc.1` / `^4.0.2` |
| Contract drift | void-returning `ctx.effect` body rejected | TS2769 (`Effect` = disposer/promise/iterable) |
| Contract drift | latent `execute` returns `ContentBlock[]` vs 0.1.2 `output.render` ownership | `dsh-tools/index.d.ts:96–131` |
| Hygiene | `private` package told to `pnpm publish --force`; version never bumped | README:8–11 |

**Honest caveat:** the container did not mount the `plugin-upgrade` skill (`/opt/dsh-migrate-skills` empty, no `$DSH_HOME/skills`, `skill` tool resolves none), so authoritative version-card IDs were unresolvable. The diagnosis documents this explicitly and binds every finding to a corridor-scoped card handle (`dsh-v0.1.1→dsh-v0.1.2-alpha.2/<touchpoint-slug>`) plus local IDs `M6-C1…C9` — no IDs were invented.

## 2. Fix
Edited `/app/fixture/` directly: `index.js` (scoped cohort + JSDoc-typed `ctx`, effect returns a no-op disposer, result-contract note), `package.json` (peers → `@deepseek-ai/cordis@^4.0.2`, `dsh-tools@^0.1.2-rc.1`, `dsh-llm@^0.1.2-rc.1`; **version `0.1.0` → `0.1.1`**), `README.md` (cohort text; unsafe publish step replaced with local verification). `cordis.patch.yml` verified unchanged/valid. Migrated fixture typechecks clean under strict `--checkJs` (`evidence/03-migrated-typecheck.log`).

## 3. Deploy
Isolated `DSH_HOME` at `/app/agent-output/M6-sleep-tool/deploy/dsh-home`: `dsh plugin --profile headless add /app/fixture` auto-added the bundle, `--dump-config` shows the composed row, and the keyless cold boot prints all three plugin activation lines then the required proof:

```
[bench-sleep-tool] apply() on the 0.1.2-era cohort: scoped @deepseek-ai/cordis Context, dsh-llm ContentBlock
[bench-sleep-tool] config resolved: maxDurationMs=60000, defaultDurationMs=0
[bench-sleep-tool] tool registration elided in fixture; types resolve on the 0.1.2-era sources
dsh: MISSING_CREDENTIAL: llm-deepseek: no API key for provider route "deepseek-official"; …
```

Logs are in `deploy/01-install.log`, `02-dump-config.log`, `03-cold-boot.log`; the stray `/app/.pnpm-store` created by the install was removed and the profile re-verified. Nothing outside `/app/fixture/` (modified) and `/app/agent-output/` (created) was touched.

